## About this package

This package provides the ONNX Runtime v${EMGU_ONNXRUNTIME_CUDA_VERSION} CUDA and TensorRT GPU execution provider libraries.

This package provides the native ONNX Runtime CUDA and TensorRT execution provider dependency for EMGU software libraries. It depends on the base `${EMGU_ONNXRUNTIME_NUGET_ID}` package, which must also be installed.

For for information, please visit
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki>

## Note

If you are targeting .Net Framework, please read this first:
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/index.php/Download_And_Installation#Targeting_.Net_Framework>

If you have issues getting the pacakge installed for your project, and your project use packages.config to manage nuget packages, the following instructions will help:
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/index.php/Download_And_Installation#Upgrade_from_packages.config_to_package_reference>

## Publishing with `dotnet publish -r <rid>`

This package ships its native binary under the standard, portable `win-x64`
RID only (this build only provides the ONNX Runtime CUDA/TensorRT execution
provider native binaries for Windows x64), so `dotnet publish -r win-x64`
works without any extra configuration.
